+## Deploy on Wasmer
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=viliusle%2FminiPaint)
+
+Wasmer serves the repository root as a static site, including the prebuilt `dist/bundle.js`: the `Staticfile` in the repository root selects static hosting, and no build step runs. The button opens Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the configuration and click Deploy; it does not create a copy of the repository in your GitHub account. To customize the editor, fork this repository, rebuild `dist/` with `npm run build` after changing `src/`, and import your own repository on Wasmer.
